 dance total describe the regular non-senior schedule\; seniors finish regu
 lar classes May 14. Assessment windows\, senior ceremonies and final repor
 t cards do not establish extra regular class days. Summer school is a sepa
 rate Monday-Thursday program. Separate charter and adult-education schedul
 es have not been verified here.
